\fs36 \cf0 \ul \ulc0 Project Description:
\fs28 \ulnone \
\pard\pardeftab720\sa140\partightenfactor0
\cf0 \expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
SK Electronics is a server-side shopping cart web application developed using Node.js and Express.\uc0\u8232 The application simulates an online electronics store where customers can browse products, search/filter items, add items to a cart, and submit orders.\
\pard\pardeftab720\sa240\partightenfactor0
\cf0 The system also includes an administrative interface that allows management of products and customer orders.\

\f1\fs36 \kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 \
\ul Instructions - How to Initialize the Database:
\fs24 \
\ulnone The project includes a seed script that creates: 1 admin user, 1 customer user, sample products\ul \
\ulnone 1. Run: \'91\cf2 node seed.js\cf0 \'92  - recreate the SQLite database and insert sample data\
2. Database file created - shopping.sqlite\
\

\fs36 \ul Instructions - How to Run the Application
\fs24 \ulnone \
1. Run: \'91\cf2 npm install\cf0 \'92 - install dependencies\
2. Run: \'91\cf2 npm start\cf0 \'92 - start server\
3. Open \'91\cf2 http://localhost:3000\cf0 \'92\
\

